    # "Третий день."
    "Day three."

# game/events/day3.rpy:32
translate english day3_linh_visit_d8502f7f:

    # "Стук в дверь."
    "A knock at the door."

# game/events/day3.rpy:35
translate english day3_linh_visit_a41fd0b6:

    # l "Добрый день, Квист. Как спалось?"
    l "Good afternoon, Kvist. How did you sleep?"

# game/events/day3.rpy:38
translate english day3_linh_visit_90483478:

    # "Квист потирает набитые шишики."
    "Kvist rubs his bruises."

# game/events/day3.rpy:40
translate english day3_linh_visit_6ed410ac:

    # k "Как обычно."
    k "As usual."

# game/events/day3.rpy:42
translate english day3_linh_visit_6970d283:

    # l "Кстати, читал про ограбление Лувра в 2025?"
    l "By the way, did you read about the Louvre heist in 2025?"

# game/events/day3.rpy:43
translate english day3_linh_visit_447a1e23:

    # k "Я не очень интериceюсь таким"
    k "I'm not really interested in that kind of thing."

# game/events/day3.rpy:45
translate english day3_linh_visit_bba2f65b:

    # l "Несколько месяцев планировали 7 минут, есть чему поучиться."
    l "They planned it for several months, but it only took seven minutes. There's something to learn from that."

# game/events/day3.rpy:47
translate english day3_linh_visit_a788ae90:

    # "Ну ладно, там все равно их поймали потом"
    "Well, they got caught afterward anyway."

# game/events/day3.rpy:52
translate english day3_linh_visit_3f7ec16b:

    # l "Как там мой заказ?"
    l "How's my order coming along?"

# game/events/day3.rpy:54
